
📊 Retail Customer Behavior & RFM Analysis 


🚀 Project Overview

This project analyzes retail customer purchasing behavior using the RFM (Recency, Frequency, Monetary) framework to segment customers based on their engagement and spending patterns.

The objective is to help businesses identify:

High-value customers

Loyal customers

Customers at risk of churn

Inactive customers

The project is implemented using PySpark (Big Data Processing) and visualized using Power BI Dashboard.




